  source_lineage: archive-compost.md
  notes: >-
    Draws a sharp line: deprecated means "planned for removal in a future
    release," removed means "removed and no longer supported." Grafana
    notifies users two minor releases in advance before anything disappears,
    with a stock notice template ("Starting with [release], [feature] is
    deprecated. It will be removed in a future release.").
